Autodesk trademarks and the Navisworks .NET API
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

NavisCoord is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Autodesk, Inc.

Autodesk, Navisworks, Revit and BIM 360 are trademarks or registered
trademarks of Autodesk, Inc., and/or its subsidiaries and/or affiliates in
the USA and/or other countries. They are used here only to identify the
software this project interoperates with.

The add-in in `addin/` links against the Navisworks .NET API at BUILD time:

  Autodesk.Navisworks.Api.dll
  Autodesk.Navisworks.Clash.dll
  Autodesk.Navisworks.Automation.dll

None of those assemblies are redistributed by this project, and none are
present in this repository or in any artifact it produces. They are resolved
from a local installation of Autodesk Navisworks Manage, and every project
reference sets `Private=false` so nothing is copied to the output directory.

Building or running the add-in therefore requires a licensed installation of
Autodesk Navisworks Manage (2024, 2025 or 2026), obtained from Autodesk under
Autodesk's own terms. Those terms govern your use of the Autodesk software;
this project's MIT licence covers only the code in this repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party Python dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The analysis engine has no dependencies. The MCP server and the PDF report
require the following, installed at runtime from PyPI and NOT vendored here:

  mcp        - MIT License        - https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk
  reportlab  - BSD 3-Clause       - https://www.reportlab.com/
  Pillow     - MIT-CMU License    - https://python-pillow.org/

Each is distributed by its own authors under its own licence; consult the
package metadata for the authoritative text.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Distribution of the add-in
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository ships no installer. The add-in is distributed as one ZIP per
Navisworks version, built by `scripts/Build-Release.ps1`, containing only
`NavisCoord.dll`, this NOTICE, the LICENSE and a neutral example profile.
